\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par  \cf0 1.   I recall the crown of  thorns
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 around my Jesus' head,
\par I worship the son of God
\par I call him my own King
\par from down my heart I love him
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par And look up all to him
\par My Jesus, what love is this
\par what sort of man are you?
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  2.  My pride, all my lots of sin
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 were a disgrace to you
\par but with your humble nature
\par has paid for all I owe
\par and so I am forgiven
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par I am no more condemned
\par in the heav'n I shall receive
\par Eternal glory there.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  3.   My Savior, what shall I say
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 I am yours! Holy One.
\par The sufferings that you went through
\par demands my thanks always
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Let me sing your praise alway
\par before your heav'nly throne,
\par and watch over my life span
\par that you have given me.
\par \pard\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2 
\par }

